      "content": "\n## msw\n\nMSW mocks network requests in tests.\n\nKey files:\n\n- `src/mocks/handlers.ts`: the request handlers, yours to extend.\n- `src/mocks/server.ts`: the Node server built from the handlers.\n- `src/mocks/vitest.setup.ts`: starts, resets and stops the server around tests; add it to `setupFiles` in your Vitest config.\n",
